  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This connector cable is designed for linking 18650 battery packs equipped with PH2.0 terminals, and supplies power to electronic components fitted with XH2.54 connectors—such as CyberBrick RC Shields."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Consideration"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "​Before use, always verify the compatible voltage range listed in the product details page for your specific device.​"
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Instruction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p>This connector cable is designed for linking 18650 battery packs equipped with PH2.0 terminals, and supplies power to electronic components fitted with XH2.54 connectors—such as CyberBrick RC Shields.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 78px;\"><!-- 物品清单布局 --><!-- 标题加文案结束 --> <!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; height: 55px; width: 102.611px; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 55px; width: 166.056px; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Connector Model</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 55px; width: 118.611px; padding: 10px !important;\">Length(mm)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 55px; width: 206.403px; padding: 10px !important;\">Outer Diameter (mm)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 55px; width: 112.236px; padding: 10px !important;\">Wire Gauge</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; height: 23px; width: 102.611px; padding: 10px !important;\">PD002</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 23px; width: 166.056px; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">PH2.0 - XH2.54</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 23px; width: 118.611px; padding: 10px !important;\">50</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 23px; width: 206.403px; padding: 10px !important;\">1.3</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 23px; width: 112.236px; padding: 10px !important;\">22AWG</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Consideration</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>​Before use, always verify the compatible voltage range listed in the product details page for your specific device.​</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
